## 4. Credentials

All credentials are stored in **your** credential vault (Vaultwarden), running on your own hardware.

- Every default password on every device was changed at commissioning.
- Every password is unique, generated, and at least sixteen characters.
- Administrative accounts require two-factor authentication.
- There is no account named `admin` and no shared administrative account.
- **The Company retains no copy of your credentials after handover.**

To recover administrative access if you are locked out, follow the recovery procedure supplied with
the vault. Keep the printed recovery copy somewhere safe and off-site.

