{% if respaldo.destino_externo %}| Off-site | {{ respaldo.destino_externo.destino }} — **controlled by you** |
{% else %}| Off-site | **None chosen.** A fire or theft that takes the equipment takes both local copies with it. |
{% endif %}| Restore test | {{ respaldo.frecuencia_prueba }}, evidenced in the service record |
| Recovery objective | **Full rebuild from template plus backup in under four hours** |

**What is backed up:** system configuration, automations, dashboards, device database, network
configuration exports, credential vault.

**What is not backed up: your video.** It is protected by drive redundancy only, where your package
includes redundancy. **Redundancy is not backup** — it protects against a drive failing, not against
deletion, corruption or ransomware.

**The encryption key is yours.** We do not hold it. Without it, the backup cannot be recovered.

