## 8. Scope reminder

This system is **not** a fire, smoke, gas, carbon monoxide or medical alert system, and **not** a
monitored intrusion alarm. Sirens are deterrent devices. Air quality sensors are not gas detectors.
Alerts go to you and to contacts you designate, and to no one else.

See the signed Scope of Work and Exclusions document.
